<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Halther Marine lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Halther Marine lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter downgraded Halter Marine Group Inc to accumulate from buy, a Dean Witter source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3/8 at 17-1/2 in early trading.</p>
</text>
